{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>創夢天地配股集資超過5,800萬元。</p><p></p><p>每股配售價0.31元，較上日收市價折讓一成，配售逾1.87億股新股，佔已擴大發行股本百分之8.4，集資所得將悉數用於AI智能體相關技術研發，遊戲產品運營推廣及遊戲研發。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.017692+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:45.491901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:45.491901+00:00","content_hash":"856552d75632f4671791baa0a95958db02fb8daed57f0ee3080c43f49c7c9626","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}